	<summary>
		<band height="258" splitType="Stretch">
			<staticText>
				<reportElement positionType="Float" x="1" y="14" width="554" height="93" forecolor="#F70521" uuid="d75aa995-e400-44e1-aec8-8db31a11dc1f"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" markup="none">
					<font fontName="Inter" size="9"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[1) When issuing TR/Shed Receipt, be particular to state quantity and measurement.
2) Tally must be maintained correctly as per marks & Nos: by physical counting.
3) Cargo must be handled with care while consolidation and stuffing, so that no damage occurs.
4) All goods in bad codition must be refused.
5) Cargo storege in containers must done promptly.
6) Containers must be inspected in respect of leakages, damages, etc., prior to stuffing. No. cargo
should be stuffed in the container if any leakage or damage is detected.

]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<textField textAdjust="StretchHeight" isBlankWhenNull="false">
				<reportElement positionType="Float" stretchType="ElementGroupHeight" x="2" y="190" width="552" height="66" uuid="e0edd038-ac39-4b38-b052-50f6b815c52f">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.leftIndent" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement verticalAlignment="Middle">
					<font fontName="Inter"/>
					<paragraph leftIndent="3"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Respectfully" + System.lineSeparator() +

$P{SIGNED_BY} + System.lineSeparator() +
"E-MAIL: " + $P{SIGNED_BY_EMAIL}+ System.lineSeparator() +
"CELL : " + $P{SIGNED_BY_CONTACT}]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement positionType="Float" x="1" y="120" width="554" height="56" forecolor="#F70521" uuid="161b2d03-7117-4449-b385-002017c9d86e"/>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" markup="none">
					<font fontName="Inter" size="9"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[1) This shipping order is subject to availability of space/container and waiver where applicable.
2) Cut-of time for stuffing of dry containers: 0730 hrs of the day vessel Berthing incase of container Vessels and 48 hrs prior to the sailling in case of Combi-Vessels.
3) No additional clause will be allowed in Bills of Lading.
4) Bills of Lading must be submitted within 24 hrs from the time of shipment.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="0" width="554" height="14" forecolor="#F70521" uuid="00338ee2-a379-4c24-bb03-59a7d9b42680">
